# Copy this file to ".env.local" and paste your own key after the = sign.
# .env.local is ignored by Git, so your key never gets uploaded.
# Get a free key at https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api
#
# No "VITE_" prefix on purpose: only the server function (api/movies.ts) can read it,
# so the key never ends up in the website's code. On Vercel, add the same name
# under Project → Settings → Environment Variables.
TMDB_API_KEY=
